When upstream PDFs are retrieved by scripts/fetch_sources.py, their bytes
are unchanged and checked against their Git blob hashes. The committed
plain-text extractions are transformations of those PDFs, with page
markers and workflow boilerplate removed; they are provided for searching,
not as authoritative mathematical typesetting. The new manuscripts change
the constructions, bounds, and explanations as detailed in their provenance
sections. Attribution to the upstream papers is required when reusing their
material. License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ .

